  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/iobcat3/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review at 100b6fbb6e: one fixture per shape, verify-claims host_secret->network: URLopener.open, SMTP_SSL.sendmail, SMTP.login, FTP_TLS.storbinary, IMAP4_SSL.login, POP3_SSL.pass_, multiprocessing.connection.Client(...).send, SSLContext().wrap_socket(s).sendall all inconclusive rc=2 'could not classify'; control SMTP.sendmail violated rc=1. A clean http.client GET reads inconclusive (HTTPSConnection). WI-tumol is merged (e1b4e10b7c); _member_return_type is live, so the wrap_socket/Client one-row fixes are available. MECHANISM: rows/slots keyed to exact classes with no subclass inheritance or completeness, and producer return types missing. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-hadif,WI-pusah."  # 8d7f
